# SN 46.2 (Kāya, "The Body") states the same 12 "fuels" claims as SN 46.51 sections 1-12. A claim stated twice is ONE claim with two citations, not two
# nodes, so these lines only add citations to the existing nutriments (see DECISIONS.md D12).
# Checked pair by pair (2026-11-14): the English is identical for all 12. The Pali is identical
# for 10; n-07 differs only in commas, n-10 in commas and one spelling variant
# (kāyappassaddhi in SN 46.51, kāyapassaddhi in SN 46.2).
# SN 46.2 has no "starves" side; its body-and-food simile is not modelled (see coverage.ttl).

